@title STORY • CHLOE: BETWEEN THE POSTS
@bg soccer_pitch_night
You're Chloe Park. Goalkeeper. Irvine, California. You stand alone between two posts for ninety minutes. You like it that way. Nobody can sneak up on you.
@show maya
Maya used to stand next to you at every party. You were the gossip duo. Then she screenshotted your close friends story.
Maya: (walking past) Nice save today.
> [Bitchy] "Gonna screenshot it?" -> a1
> [Sweet] "...Thanks." -> a2
*a1
@add Maya_Beef 2
Maya flinches. Just a little. You see it. Goalkeepers see everything.
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Maya_Bond 2
Maya stops walking. She turns around. She almost says something. She doesn't.
*a_done
@bg dorm_room_night
At 1 a.m., Maya texts: "i'm sorry. i shouldn't have posted it. i was jealous you had a close friends list i wasn't on."
You read it ten times. She wasn't on it because you made it about her.
> [Sweet] "you weren't on it because the whole story was about you, dummy." -> b1
> [Good] "thank you for saying sorry. i need a little time." -> b2
*b1
@add Maya_Bond 3
Maya: "WHAT"
Maya: "chloe"
Maya: "CHLOE"
You turn your phone face-down, smiling. Let her stew for one night. She deserves that much.
@jump end
*b2
@add Self 2
Maya: "ok. i'll wait."
And she does. That's how you know she meant it.
*end
Chloe Park keeps everything out of the net. This year, she's learning which things are worth letting in.
